So, um, where's Suzuki?

271
00:11:33,380 --> 00:11:34,580
I don't know what you mean, bro.

272
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:36,540
Why don't you get on in there and do shopping?

273
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:39,140
We were never here. This is all just a bad dream.

274
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:39,620
What?

275
00:11:39,620 --> 00:11:46,860
Could you please say something, dude?

276
00:11:48,300 --> 00:11:50,280
Run! Quick before he sees the shorts!

277
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,120
He thinks he's asleep, so you're safe.

278
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:54,240
I'm in your debt!

279
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:55,580
Hey, that's my helmet!

280
00:11:55,580 --> 00:12:00,320
I'm sorry, Tani. I want you to see most versions of me.

281
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,440
You just can't see this one.

282
00:12:01,660 --> 00:12:05,000
I'm taking makeup-less goblin Suzuki and her ratty gym shorts to my grave.

283
00:12:05,420 --> 00:12:08,160
I'll never let you see my disappointing, not-hot self.

284
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:08,860
Never!

285
00:12:08,860 --> 00:12:14,700
Okay, you can't catch me now.

286
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:17,540
Eat my dust, Achilles. I'm the mother-flipping donut!

287
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:19,320
Suzuki, wait.

288
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:22,580
Oh, dear Pits, Achilles.

289
00:12:22,580 --> 00:12:26,300
Why are you running away?

290
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:30,320
I look gross!

291
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:35,860
You do know that none of that bothers me, right?

292
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:40,340
I know you don't think it's a big deal, but it bothers the crap out of me.

293
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,820
My carefully crafted vibes are in ruins.

294
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:44,740
Is that so?

295
00:12:49,380 --> 00:12:51,600
Why don't you care if Yamada sees you like this?

296
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:51,800
Huh?

297
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:58,800
Because I don't vibe with Yamada like that.

298
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:01,680
I've known him since middle school. I don't care how I look with him.

299
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:03,480
And Taira and Watanabe?

300
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:07,600
Let's see. Nabe and I met our first year of high school, and Taira...

301
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:09,360
Well, he's just Taira, you feel me?

302
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:11,120
I see.

303
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:17,620
Excuse me. You're clearly upset. How come you're running away from me?

304
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:20,080
I'm not the one who literally ran away tonight.

305
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:21,280
Wow. Sassy.

306
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:28,100
It's just, you've known your friends for so much longer than you've known me, I get a little jealous sometimes.

307
00:13:28,100 --> 00:13:43,420
Listen, Tawny. Imagine I have two plates, okay? Now, one's a pile of eggs and rice on a paper plate, and the other's perfect omu rice on a fancy platter.

308
00:13:43,420 --> 00:13:49,640
Even if they taste the exact same, it doesn't matter because I'm always going to want to give you the nicer dish.

309
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:52,240
I want to be the nice rice! Let me serve!

310
00:13:52,240 --> 00:14:00,460
But I don't care about how it's presented. None of that matters to me as long as I like the food.

311
00:14:00,460 --> 00:14:06,680
Wait. That kind of sucks.

312
00:14:06,680 --> 00:14:07,680
Why?

313
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:15,500
If you see a carefully crafted bougie dessert, you gotta acknowledge it and say, wow, that's so pretty, or this is beautiful, to show respect.

314
00:14:15,500 --> 00:14:19,000
Respect? For the vibes.

315
00:14:20,260 --> 00:14:21,820
Exactly! For the vibes!

316
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:27,640
Slow down! Let me ride on the back.

317
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:30,640
If you want. But it might get wobbly.

318
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:32,640
Wobble it up, wobble boy!

319
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:39,540
Oh, man, that feels good!

320
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:49,100
Um, Tawny, you know how summer nights have this unique kind of feel to them? Like a special mood?

321
00:14:50,040 --> 00:14:53,740
Well, I think it's one of the best feelings there is.

322
00:14:54,460 --> 00:14:55,320
I do, too.

323
00:14:56,820 --> 00:14:58,140
And it smells nice.

324
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:01,380
I love the scent in the air after it rains.

325
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:12,120
Yeah, I love it, too.

326
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:19,320
Huh?

327
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:27,800
Aren't you Suzuki's sister? Go home before I call your mom!

328
00:15:28,140 --> 00:15:29,060
Aye-aye, sir!

329
00:15:29,580 --> 00:15:31,980
Should I be worried about her criminal record?

330
00:15:31,980 --> 00:15:33,100
Hup, hup!

331
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:38,900
Eee! I'm gonna die of hype! The festival's almost here!

332
00:15:39,300 --> 00:15:41,800
You sure I've perked up now that finals are over.

333
00:15:42,340 --> 00:15:44,360
So are you guys going to the widow event?

334
00:15:44,580 --> 00:15:52,800
Uh-huh. Fireworks rule, but it's always a bloodbath finding a good spot just to wait hours for the show to start, and then taking the train home is like fighting off a mob.

335
00:15:52,900 --> 00:15:54,000
Cold, hard fats.

336
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:56,680
Should I wear a yukita, or is that too over the top?

337
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:59,220
What? Don't be ridiculous! Of course you should wear one!

338
00:15:59,380 --> 00:16:01,400
Who knows how much longer you have as a couple!

339
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:02,580
What did you say?

340
00:16:02,660 --> 00:16:03,720
Don't put that negative to me!

341
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:06,380
I'm just saying you should think about the air!

342
00:16:06,380 --> 00:16:07,120
No one's asking!

343
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:10,540
In Ambe-speak, that means say what you feel and don't take him for granted.

344
00:16:10,900 --> 00:16:11,260
Yes.

345
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:12,220
Wow, wise.

346
00:16:12,900 --> 00:16:16,440
That said, don't become one of those couples who can't turn the mush off.

347
00:16:16,660 --> 00:16:17,500
As if!

348
00:16:17,500 --> 00:16:47,020
I wonder what he'll think. Maybe I overdid it? Or maybe I didn't do enough? Should I have gone to the salon? How did people manage to cram everything into these tiny drawstring bags? Are folk sandals, like, obscenely tacky?

349
00:16:47,020 --> 00:16:49,820
Gosh, I'm sweating so much, my makeup's gonna be soup!

350
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:53,240
No! Get your ish together, girl! You can do this!

351
00:16:57,820 --> 00:16:58,300
Tani!

352
00:16:59,920 --> 00:17:01,100
Sorry for the wait.

353
00:17:04,700 --> 00:17:05,140
Yukita?

354
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:08,020
Yeah, so, you like it?

355
00:17:10,460 --> 00:17:11,320
You're beautiful.

356
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:20,920
Prior to this moment, I might have occasionally cleared the cute bar, but I think this is the first time anyone's ever called me beautiful!

357
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:23,480
Let's rage, Tani! Time to tear it up!

358
00:17:23,940 --> 00:17:24,160
Yeah!

359
00:17:24,740 --> 00:17:26,640
I don't think we need to go that far.

360
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:32,280
Whoa! Don't you just love all the sights and sounds?

361
00:17:32,540 --> 00:17:32,760
Yeah.

362
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:38,520
I'm gonna scan the boots real quick and decide what to get. Let me know if you want anything, okay?

363
00:17:40,120 --> 00:17:41,520
Hey, watch out behind you.

364
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:44,600
I'm sorry!

365
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:45,580
It's all good.

366
00:17:47,140 --> 00:17:48,860
Guess this is the danger zone.

367
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:52,520
Gotta be careful with the herd around, am I right?

368
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:58,020
Yeah, right.

369
00:18:07,820 --> 00:18:08,420
What's up?

370
00:18:08,940 --> 00:18:11,440
You and me! We're like a legit couple.

371
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:19,160
Oh, man. This is exactly what Sato warned me about.

372
00:18:19,740 --> 00:18:25,560
I see Tani every day at school, but that's why being out like this feels extra special and soups romantic.

373
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:26,960
I gotta be cool.

374
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:29,700
I can't let myself get lost in the sauce.

375
00:18:30,740 --> 00:18:31,140
Yummy!

376
00:18:32,420 --> 00:18:33,240
Nope, too late.

377
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:35,260
I just can't help myself!

378
00:18:36,180 --> 00:18:36,660
Yay!

379
00:18:36,660 --> 00:18:41,000
At a time like this, how could I not turn into a mega-mushy-mush-ball?

380
00:18:41,380 --> 00:18:41,740
Wah!

381
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:45,500
Holy god, boy can scoop!

382
00:18:52,260 --> 00:18:54,500
You didn't have to share one with little ol' me.

383
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:56,980
That's fine. You can take both of them if you want.

384
00:18:57,220 --> 00:18:58,320
But they're your trophies.

385
00:18:58,700 --> 00:19:03,060
Oh, let me know if you need to wipe your hands. I packed a metric crap ton of these bad boys.

386
00:19:03,300 --> 00:19:04,440
You're so prepared.

387
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:06,540
Duh! I made a checklist for tonight!

388
00:19:07,260 --> 00:19:09,580
I mean, Noah didn't! I'm just really chic and smart!

389
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:11,720
Thank you.

390
00:19:17,380 --> 00:19:19,380
Could this night get any better?

391
00:19:23,140 --> 00:19:24,940
I love you, Taku!

392
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:26,260
I love you, too!

393
00:19:29,540 --> 00:19:30,060
Groanie!

394
00:19:30,480 --> 00:19:32,840
This is a gosh dang family event, people!

395
00:19:33,340 --> 00:19:34,660
R.I.P. my eyes!

396
00:19:34,660 --> 00:19:38,160
Is that what happens when your giddy meter maxes out and you turn into a mush monster?

397
00:19:38,580 --> 00:19:40,140
I guess I can't be too weirded out.

398
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:43,100
Deep down inside, part of me totally gets how they feel.

399
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:46,380
I'm cool as a cucumber when Tawny's not around.

400
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:51,800
It's easy to assume I'm not going to act a certain way or lose sight of everything when he's not right in front of me.

401
00:19:52,220 --> 00:19:53,080
And yet...

402
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:55,200
What have I been like this entire night?

403
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:58,980
Oh, God!

404
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:00,660
I'm the mush monster!

405
00:20:01,040 --> 00:20:02,580
What have I become?

406
00:20:04,300 --> 00:20:05,120
Something wrong?

407
00:20:05,500 --> 00:20:07,240
Do you need to get home by a certain time?

408
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:08,900
No, it's not that.

409
00:20:09,420 --> 00:20:10,700
Mind if we take a little walk?

410
00:20:10,940 --> 00:20:11,360
Sure.

411
00:20:17,840 --> 00:20:19,840
I've never come up this way before.

412
00:20:20,800 --> 00:20:23,220
The road's getting steeper and steeper.

413
00:20:23,500 --> 00:20:24,960
Where could he be taking us?

414
00:20:24,960 --> 00:20:27,060
A make-out spot!

415
00:20:27,460 --> 00:20:27,860
Already?

416
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:29,760
We're here.

417
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:34,780
There's a lot of people here.

418
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:36,080
Yeah.

419
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:38,440
Whoa!

420
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:44,240
So, no smooching.

421
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:46,360
Why did he bring us here?

422
00:20:46,780 --> 00:20:48,140
Makes me kind of nervous.

423
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:49,780
I'm bored!

424
00:20:50,280 --> 00:20:52,120
When are the fireworks going to start?

425
00:20:52,240 --> 00:20:53,040
Just be patient.

426
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:53,940
They'll start soon.

427
00:20:54,100 --> 00:20:54,280
Huh?

428
00:20:58,800 --> 00:21:00,100
Holy smokes!

429
00:21:00,700 --> 00:21:02,940
Is that the fireworks show we skipped out on?

430
00:21:03,120 --> 00:21:04,580
You can see them from here?

431
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:06,140
Sorry I couldn't get us closer.

432
00:21:06,220 --> 00:21:06,860
Who cares?

433
00:21:06,860 --> 00:21:08,420
This is totally awesome!

434
00:21:11,560 --> 00:21:12,340
Thank you.

435
00:21:12,880 --> 00:21:13,760
For everything.

436
00:21:17,680 --> 00:21:19,500
Wonder if my camera can catch them.

437
00:21:19,540 --> 00:21:21,140
They're far away, so it might not work.

438
00:21:21,420 --> 00:21:21,880
Yeah.

439
00:21:22,180 --> 00:21:22,900
Too bad.

440
00:21:24,540 --> 00:21:26,400
I'll have to burn them into my brain.

441
00:21:26,400 --> 00:21:37,220
That was a close one.

442
00:21:39,220 --> 00:21:39,940
Whoa!

443
00:21:40,500 --> 00:21:41,100
Awesome!

444
00:21:43,300 --> 00:21:43,940
OMG!

445
00:21:44,800 --> 00:21:46,920
We came so, so close to kissing!

446
00:21:48,500 --> 00:21:50,500
Actually, maybe we should have.

447
00:21:51,100 --> 00:21:51,700
Crap.

448
00:21:51,700 --> 00:21:54,720
Well, now I totally want to.

449
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:56,600
Suzuki?

450
00:21:57,100 --> 00:21:57,280
Ah!

451
00:21:58,060 --> 00:21:59,840
Next time, let's get even closer.

452
00:22:00,220 --> 00:22:00,760
Hang on!

453
00:22:01,080 --> 00:22:01,480
Closer?

454
00:22:01,800 --> 00:22:03,400
Like, you really wanna...

455
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:04,500
Closer to the show.

456
00:22:04,940 --> 00:22:06,000
We can go next year.

457
00:22:06,600 --> 00:22:07,280
If you want.

458
00:22:07,280 --> 00:22:14,020
Oh, yeah!

459
00:22:14,300 --> 00:22:15,180
Let's go!

460
00:22:17,700 --> 00:22:18,800
He said next year!

461
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:20,500
He said next year!

462
00:22:20,980 --> 00:22:21,660
I'm gonna die!

463
00:22:21,660 --> 00:22:30,900
So, how was your festival date?

464
00:22:31,040 --> 00:22:31,500
Oh, yeah!

465
00:22:31,580 --> 00:22:32,820
Your girl scored Big Ten!

466
00:22:32,960 --> 00:22:34,120
Yeah, that's Super Bowl.

467
00:22:34,120 --> 00:22:35,380
Oh, yeah!

468
00:22:43,300 --> 00:22:43,520
Yeah, hey!

469
00:22:43,780 --> 00:22:46,440
お決まりのフレーズは

470
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:49,340
引き出しの中へ

471
00:22:49,340 --> 00:22:52,660
何よりも振り切って

472
00:22:52,660 --> 00:22:55,000
声を出してみる

473
00:22:55,000 --> 00:22:58,100
鏡の奥まで

474
00:22:58,100 --> 00:23:00,160
目を凝らして

475
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:02,440
Ah, jigsaw na

476
00:23:02,440 --> 00:23:27,100
道を抜け 居合わせた影も 曇る窓へ描くように 縁取ってほしい 言葉で透き通ったり 縮む幻 差し込めた 火を踏んで 跳ねた色も 少しだけ好きになる

477
00:23:27,100 --> 00:23:50,260
ねえ 今を隠されちゃうラインに 意外な魔法をかけ合って わからなくて わからないねって話して

478
00:23:50,260 --> 00:23:58,660
音頭が触った後に 混じってた 匂いが 雨みたいにしたってる

